# HP50g Stock Font Gallery launch through the original UI and ARMToolbox.
# Exhaustive traversal of all 308 generated faces belongs to Direct Gallery.
# This compact Stock payload proves the native UI -> ARMToolbox -> standard
# HPC1 path with both native faces and one representative generated face.
2000 chord lshift files
4200 capture files
4500 tap up
4800 tap f6
6500 capture sd
6900 tap enter
7200 tap down
7600 capture sd-payload
8000 tap f2
9200 capture copy-destination
9500 tap down
9800 tap f6
20000 capture copy-result
20500 tap f4
21800 capture recalled-in-filer
22200 tap nxt
22600 tap nxt
23400 capture filer-halt-menu
23800 tap f1
25100 capture payload-recalled
25600 chord rshift two
26850 capture lib
27200 tap f1
28500 capture armtoolbox
28700 monitor 90000
28900 tap f1
# Compact Gallery starts on Native / calculator minifont. DOWN changes face
# within the Native family; RIGHT then advances to the generated-control family.
40000 capture native-mini
41500 tap down
43000 capture native-main
44500 tap right
46000 capture generated-control
47500 tap on
